<item><title>West Darfur launches campaign to protect women and girls from violence</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/west-darfur-launches-campaign-to-protect-women-and-girls-d47f5b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/west-darfur-launches-campaign-to-protect-women-and-girls-d47f5b/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The state began its 16 Days of Activism drive as officials and aid workers warned that war and displacement heighten risks of abuse.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:11:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>UN condemns Blue Nile drone strikes that killed 17 civilians</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/un-condemns-blue-nile-drone-strikes-that-killed-17-civilians-5368a1/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/un-condemns-blue-nile-drone-strikes-that-killed-17-civilians-5368a1/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The UN says the attacks came amid escalating fighting and displacement, with more than 6,700 families recently displaced at two sites in El Roseires.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:10:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>African Union chief backs Ethiopia&apos;s proposed Sudan dialogue</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/african-union-chief-backs-ethiopia-s-proposed-sudan-dialogue-a5321a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/african-union-chief-backs-ethiopia-s-proposed-sudan-dialogue-a5321a/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>Mahamoud Ali Youssouf says any talks must be Sudanese-led and preserve Sudan&apos;s sovereignty and unity, while the transitional government says it is ready to engage.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:22:51 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tasees forces claim control of Maqanza area and military camp</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/tasees-forces-claim-control-of-maqanza-area-and-military-b0bc07/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/tasees-forces-claim-control-of-maqanza-area-and-military-b0bc07/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The RSF-aligned forces said they sent specialised reinforcements to secure the area in Blue Nile state.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:04:16 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sudan food prices rise 57.23% as households cut other spending</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-food-prices-rise-57-23-as-households-cut-other-1c1f8f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-food-prices-rise-57-23-as-households-cut-other-1c1f8f/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>October data show food and beverage prices rose 15.27% in a month, while an economist says families are delaying treatment and reducing food consumption.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:44:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-food-prices-rise-57-23-as-households-cut-other-1c1f8f/share.jpg" length="42226" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-food-prices-rise-57-23-as-households-cut-other-1c1f8f/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
